WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.426
In one minute, you will change your entry, then take it out of the contest.

00:00:04.426 --> 00:00:05.485
We start on the map.

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:09.778
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.104 --> 00:00:14.545
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.545 --> 00:00:17.053
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:18.409
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.203 --> 00:00:22.527
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.527 --> 00:00:23.210
Tap Allow.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.515
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:30.515 --> 00:00:31.639
See the three dots?

00:00:31.639 --> 00:00:32.145
Tap them.

00:00:34.932 --> 00:00:36.767
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.363
Tap Mine.

00:00:39.363 --> 00:00:42.148
Under Homes you entered, tap Open contest.

00:00:43.842 --> 00:00:45.340
Tap Open contest.

00:00:47.462 --> 00:00:48.424
Find Your home.

00:00:48.424 --> 00:00:50.226
Tap Edit name and description.

00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:54.162
Change the name, then tap Save.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.658
To take your home out, tap Withdraw.

00:01:01.346 --> 00:01:05.028
It asks you to tap again, so you cannot do it by accident.

00:01:05.028 --> 00:01:05.839
Tap it again.

00:01:07.787 --> 00:01:09.610
Next up: Your profile.
